    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Release date announce</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >limbus\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2025.5.23 out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908670/extras/dd72e036c8dd5fd9e687cc999d1f2ad2.avif?t=1748071208\" width=680 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010about limbus\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limbus is a horror walking simulator game in which the protagonist explores an endless corridor in search of a way out and salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player choose between two paths, left or right, and choose the correct path while avoiding the paths with anomalies to go deeper into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908670/extras/1a50b413c892fb7d5ed1bf6c1482a9c2.poster.avif?t=1748071208\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908670/extras/1a50b413c892fb7d5ed1bf6c1482a9c2.webm?t=1748071208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908670/extras/1a50b413c892fb7d5ed1bf6c1482a9c2.mp4?t=1748071208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies are signs that danger is approaching for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to be on the lookout for anomalies,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And never forget the past you have walked through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are on the surface of the deep.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There are only two things you can do in this place.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose your path and keep going.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And two things you must not do.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>To miss an anomaly, to forget the path you've taken.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don't let Them Engulf You </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The darkness is there.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Release date announce</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >limbus\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2025.5.23 out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908670/extras/dd72e036c8dd5fd9e687cc999d1f2ad2.avif?t=1748071208\" width=680 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010about limbus\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limbus is a horror walking simulator game in which the protagonist explores an endless corridor in search of a way out and salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player choose between two paths, left or right, and choose the correct path while avoiding the paths with anomalies to go deeper into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908670/extras/1a50b413c892fb7d5ed1bf6c1482a9c2.poster.avif?t=1748071208\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908670/extras/1a50b413c892fb7d5ed1bf6c1482a9c2.webm?t=1748071208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908670/extras/1a50b413c892fb7d5ed1bf6c1482a9c2.mp4?t=1748071208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies are signs that danger is approaching for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to be on the lookout for anomalies,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And never forget the past you have walked through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are on the surface of the deep.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There are only two things you can do in this place.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose your path and keep going.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And two things you must not do.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>To miss an anomaly, to forget the path you've taken.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don't let Them Engulf You </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The darkness is there.</i></p>",
